# Debian packages

The Debian packaging builds the client and packages game data and a pinned SDL3
runtime separately. `control` declares the package dependencies; `rules` builds
the SDL3 prefix with `scons/sdl3_dependencies.py` before invoking SCons.

Use the [native build guide](../docs/development/building.md) for contributor setup
and the [release index](../docs/releases/README.md) for distribution workflows.
The historical GCC 3.0 minimum is not a supported modern compiler requirement.
